<title>UK: Raghsa Construcciones sets $35 mln Feb 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Raghsa Construcciones sets $35 mln Feb 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Prudential-Bache Securities UK Inc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RAGHAS CONSTRUCCIONES SA</p>
<p> AMT    $35 MLN	 COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    28.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    **	  LISTING     ***</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 100+ONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	   ***BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p>		THERE WILL BE A 50 PCT PRINCIPLE REPAYMENT ON</p>
<p>		28.FEB.03</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
